Cloud optimization should be treated as a continuous cycle rather than an occasional activity. Organizations should regularly evaluate resource utilization, security posture, performance, governance, and operational processes.

A continuous optimization cycle includes:

* Measure
* Analyze
* Improve
* Validate
* Monitor
* Repeat

# Real-Life Example:
For example, monthly operational reviews may identify opportunities to right-size virtual machines, improve monitoring rules, and strengthen identity security.

# Real-Life Use Case:
A real-life use case is enterprises reducing operational costs every quarter while simultaneously improving application performance.

Continuous optimization maximizes business value from Azure investments.
